# OpenOb Git Attributes Configuration
# Enforce deterministic LF line endings across all platforms (Windows, macOS, Linux)
# Prevents format-check failures on clean Windows clones with core.autocrlf=true

* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary assets (prevent any line-ending transformations or corruption)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.pdf binary
*.wasm binary
